The underlying persecution data is published by [Viasna Human Rights Centre](https://ovd.info) under [public access Unported](https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/). Viasna Human Rights Centre's data license applies to the source data only, not to the analytical outputs, ontology, or report produced by this pipeline.

